# All twelve own 1H dodges (step 6.2 of the melee port, reports/Свои анимации для боя.md) played with `ani` at 1H
# talent 2 (HUMANS_1HST2, which the fixture's re-arm puts on): dash, roll and heavy roll back, left, right, forward.
# Back and forward from the side, left and right from the front; the rolls back, left and the heavy roll back again
# slowed 3x. Content from scripts/content/anim/content_pack.py; the look is judged by Claude from the clips.
# After an `ani` the hero idles in S_1H, so each take re-arms; after a goto ~2 s on the ground before `ani`.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=/abs/content
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 1500
animinfo S_1HRUN T_1HDASHB T_1HROLLB T_1HROLLHEAVYB

cam follow 400 110 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec dashb
ani player T_1HDASHB
wait 1300
stop

cam follow 420 120 0
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec dashl
ani player T_1HDASHL
wait 1300
stop

